{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621514001:0":{"text":"カラスのお兄さん、ちょっと喉を休めたらどうだね？それ以上鳴いたら、麦畑の穂まで枯れてしまうよ。","source_cn":"乌鸦兄，不如歇歇嗓子吧？再唱下去，麦田里的稻穗都枯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x286FFB66E8DA8E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621514002:0":{"text":"<hpy>黒い瞳～黒い羽～、漆黒のマントがカッコイイ！</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>黑眼睛，黑羽毛，黑黑的披风真漂亮~</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E57BE64CEDBB55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621514003:0":{"text":"また聞こえないフリですか？この騒々しい鳥め、錆びついた鈴より耳障りな声だ……","source_cn":"又装作没听到吗？这只扰民的鸟，破喉咙比生锈的铃铛还难听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634F62BC7E82E24F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621514004:0":{"text":"お二人とも、そんな悠長に構えてる場合じゃないぞ！ニャーリスがクーデターを企ててるんだ！","source_cn":"两位，现在不是悠闲的时候，喵丽丝正在策划颠覆莱希拉姆的秩序！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58C2F2ED28EEC57C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621514005:0":{"text":"あなたは……？","source_cn":"你是……？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE58A64A13DABD563","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_