e":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621514016:1":{"text":"冷静に？それはお前だろ？リーダーの真似事をして喜んでるどっかの犬と違って、ニャーリス様は新たな秩序をもたらす存在だ！","source_cn":"冷静？你才该冷静点吧。喵丽丝会带来新秩序，比你这狗队长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD4E84385129905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621514017:0":{"text":"馬閣下……おまえはどう思う？","source_cn":"……马阁下，你怎样看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4021B2DF9F0550B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1621514018:1":{"text":"ニャーリス嬢のやり方は派手すぎて、確かに私の理想とする秩序とは程遠い。","source_cn":"喵丽丝小姐的步调太喧闹，太张扬，的确不符合我理想中的秩序。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E44D5FE8EF026F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1621514019:1":{"text":"私の理想は隠遁だ。風に吹かれて露をすすり、世の争いから離れて暮らしたい。","source_cn":"不过我一心想归隐田野，随风饮露，与世无争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F3A18539F0CEC07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1621514020:1":{"text":"隠遁だと？じゃあ、さっき鼻息を吹きかけてきたのが隠遁か？笑わせるな！","source_cn":"归隐？你刚才喷我响鼻那叫归隐？别搞笑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4F04AD0B0C47BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1621514021:0":{"text":"お前なぁ……自分を貴族かなんかと思ってんのか？どう見ても、ただの田舎馬だろ！","source_cn":"你啊，别把自己说得像个隐居贵族，明明就是个土马！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F2F218A9E26E15D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1621514022:0":{"text":"なんだと？田舎……馬……！？","source_cn":"你说什么？土……马……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E4435765105C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1621514023:0":{"text":"だから、馬は山を駆け回ってるのがお似合いだって言ってんだよ！血統だなんだ言ってるのを聞くと、虫唾が走る！","source_cn":"我说你不过是匹在土堆上跑来跑去的野马，还吹什么血统！太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0579D854F553E0AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1621514024:1":{"text":"わ、私がどう生きようと自由だ！風は我がマント、大地は我が蹄鉄。これ以上に高貴なものがどこにある！","source_cn":"我、我生来自由，风是我披风，大地是我蹄铁！还有什么比这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x145C5C78004A2A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1621514025:1":{"text":"よく聞け、この忌まわしいカラス！そちらがニャーリス側に立つというなら、このアルセノ……","source_cn":"听好了！你这死乌鸦！既然你站在喵丽丝那边，那我阿尔塞诺就——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC8CEDA0EDA21D60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3